      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Playspace mover is not bannable and complete encouraged by the develpers for full body users. It's not modifying any game code. \nAvatar favorites were limited intentionally. Likely the same reason avatar searching is not a feature, to encourage world hoping and exploring people's worlds. Many avatars marked public are not meant to be attained by anyone, and are either reward avatars, or meant for only certain groups to use when they find it in a specific world. Being able to just go an grab avatars from a search breaks the whole avatar system and in a way hurts the avatar creators who upload the avatars for their worlds",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
