      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not sure if they're the same thing but I disagree with the use of modified clients but encourage the use of mods. They add so much more value to the game. If VRChat allows for the functionality that the mods provide, then I think we wouldn't need these. Moreover, I recommend VRC to have a security system that works with mods and not custom clients.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
